  "title": "Pollo a la Brasa (Peruvian Grilled Chicken)",
  "description": "For your next cookout, treat your family to a classic Peruvian chicken dish made on the grill instead of in the oven. Pollo a la brasa is simple to prepare and bursting with flavor.",
